# Loon Remote Rule — Meta Muse (separate subscription)
# Assign policy in Loon [Remote Rule]; no policy column in this file.
# Some included domains are shared Meta/Facebook services.

# ============================================================
# Meta Muse — app, login, secure VM and generated content
# Community-reported endpoints; Meta may change them at any time.
# Choose a consistent overseas proxy policy in Loon.
# ============================================================

# Muse website and application API
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,muse.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,museai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.ai

# Muse runtime / secure browser / agents
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaivm.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ecto1.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ecto1usercontent.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaiusercontent.com
DOMAIN,meta-agents-apps.workers.dev

# Meta account authentication and related services
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.com
DOMAIN,ep7.facebook.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,facebook.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fb.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbcdn.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fbsbx.com
